## tips / gotchas
- The three Explorer screens are used both as standalone screens (from Search) and embedded
  in the Tracks tab. Layout state lives in `Tracks.js` and is passed down as a prop.
- Grid view uses virtualized `LegendList numColumns={2}` in all 6 grid screens (Explorer
  grids, SearchMore, Playlists, ShowAll.web). `AllItem` root is `width:'100%'` to fill a cell.
- `addToQueue(songDispatch, track, index)` inserts at `index`; inserting at the same
  `index` repeatedly reverses order, so insert in reverse to keep wanted order.
- eslint: `npx eslint app -c eslint.config.mjs`.
- `rg -rn` is a landmine: `-r` is ripgrep's `--replace`, so `rg -rn <pat>` replaces every
  match with the literal `n`. Use `rg -n` or `--no-config`.